---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/base';

const lastUpdated = '20 August 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Delete Account"
  description="How to request deletion of your PS Laser account and data, and exactly what is and isn't covered today."
  path="/delete-account"
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Delete Account" />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="last-updated reveal">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="prose reveal">
        <div class="callout warning">
          <strong>Current status:</strong> the app has a "Delete My Account" control (Settings
          → Danger Zone), but it is not completing correctly end-to-end today — a known issue
          we're actively addressing. Until it's fixed, please use the request path below
          instead.
        </div>

        <h2>How to request account deletion</h2>
        <p>
          Email <a href="mailto:pslaser24@gmail.com?subject=Account%20Deletion%20Request">pslaser24@gmail.com</a>
          from the email address associated with your account (or include your registered name
          and employer) with the subject "Account Deletion Request." We'll confirm your
          identity with your company's Owner or Manager and process the request.
        </p>

        <h2>What deletion covers</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Your employee profile (name, role, department, shift)</li>
          <li>Your login credentials (PIN hash, security-question answer)</li>
          <li>Device push-notification tokens registered to your account</li>
          <li>Your AI assistant chat history</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>What is retained regardless of a deletion request</h2>
        <p>
          Orders, client records, and production/financial history you were involved in are
          kept as business and legal/financial records, the same way they're retained for every
          account — not specific to you. This is existing, standard practice for a
          manufacturing business's bookkeeping and audit trail, described further in our
          <a href={withBase('/privacy')}>Privacy Policy</a>. Your name may continue to appear on historical
          records (for example, "order taken by") even after your account itself is deleted.
        </p>

        <h2>Timeline</h2>
        <p>
          We aim to process deletion requests within a reasonable time after confirming your
          identity. Because this is currently a manual, request-based process rather than an
          automated one, exact timing can vary — we'll confirm with you directly once your
          request is received.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .section {
    padding-block: clamp(32px, 6vh, 64px) var(--section-gap);
  }
</style>
